{"results":[{"entryType":"UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)","primaryAccession":"Q9H2W2","uniProtkbId":"MIXL1_HUMAN","proteinDescription":{"recommendedName":{"fullName":{"value":"Homeobox protein MIXL1"}},"alternativeNames":[{"fullName":{"value":"Homeodomain protein MIX"},"shortNames":[{"value":"hMix"}]},{"fullName":{"value":"MIX1 homeobox-like protein 1"}},{"fullName":{"value":"Mix.1 homeobox-like protein"}}]},"genes":[{"geneName":{"value":"MIXL1"},"synonyms":[{"value":"MIXL"}]}],"comments":[{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000250"}],"value":"Transcription factor that play a central role in proper axial mesendoderm morphogenesis and endoderm formation. Required for efficient differentiation of cells from the primitive streak stage to blood, by acting early in the recruitment and/or expansion of mesodermal progenitors to the hemangioblastic and hematopoietic lineages. Also involved in the morphogenesis of the heart and the gut during embryogenesis. Acts as a negative regulator of brachyury expression (By similarity)"}],"commentType":"FUNCTION"}],"extraAttributes":{"uniParcId":"UPI0000070BF1"}}]}